<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-liangshu" book-id="b-liangshu-027" chapter-id="c-liangshu-027-luchui-daoqia-openings-rendered" source-id="s-liangshu-027-luchui-daoqia-openings-current-rendered">
  <p id="c-liangshu-027-luchui-daoqia-openings-rendered:p001" annotation-status="named_mentions_first_pass" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-liangshu-027-luchui-daoqia-openings-rendered:p001:m0001" ref="9jp_jmf_6jv_**BAA">陸倕</persName>字<persName id="c-liangshu-027-luchui-daoqia-openings-rendered:p001:m0002" ref="9jp_jmf_6jv_**BAA">佐公</persName>，吳郡吳人也。晉太尉<persName id="c-liangshu-027-luchui-daoqia-openings-rendered:p001:m0003" ref="9jp_jmf_6jv">玩</persName>六世孫。祖<persName id="c-liangshu-027-luchui-daoqia-openings-rendered:p001:m0004" ref="9jp_jmf_6jv_**B">子真</persName>，宋東陽太守。父<persName id="c-liangshu-027-luchui-daoqia-openings-rendered:p001:m0005" ref="9jp_jmf_6jv_**BA">慧曉</persName>，齊太常卿。</p>
  <p id="c-liangshu-027-luchui-daoqia-openings-rendered:p002" annotation-status="named_mentions_first_pass" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-liangshu-027-luchui-daoqia-openings-rendered:p002:m0001" ref="6bo_qfq_pl9_AAA">到洽</persName>字<persName id="c-liangshu-027-luchui-daoqia-openings-rendered:p002:m0002" ref="6bo_qfq_pl9_AAA">茂㳂</persName>，彭城武原人也。宋驃騎將軍<persName id="c-liangshu-027-luchui-daoqia-openings-rendered:p002:m0003" ref="6bo_qfq_pl9">彥之</persName>曾孫。祖<persName id="c-liangshu-027-luchui-daoqia-openings-rendered:p002:m0004" ref="6bo_qfq_pl9_A">仲度</persName>，驃騎<persName id="c-liangshu-027-luchui-daoqia-openings-rendered:p002:m0005" ref="2n6_7xk_5ov">江夏王</persName>從事中郎。父<persName id="c-liangshu-027-luchui-daoqia-openings-rendered:p002:m0006" ref="6bo_qfq_pl9_AA">坦</persName>，齊中書郎。</p>
</text>
